	(text "We should switch X this transformer\nso the choke is on the input, though\nthis way is giving us a 6 dB gain we\nwould lose with the choke on the input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 89.154 57.912 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
